#: scrnsave.cpp:382
msgid ""
"If the screen saver you selected has customizable features, you can set them "
"up by clicking this button."
msgstr ""
"As die skerm bewaarder jy gekose het pakmaakbaar funksies, jy kan stel hulle "
"begin deur te kliek hierdie knoppie."

